# Anaphoric pronouns that must not fill the {query} slot (OVOS-INTENT-2 §4.3).
# When the whole slot value is one of these, "what does wikihow say about it"
# or "how do you do that" carries no searchable subject; the slot is left
# unresolved so a later stage (OVOS-CONTEXT-1 §7 context fill or a re-prompt)
# can supply the referent instead of searching WikiHow for the bare pronoun.
(esso|questo|quello|questi|quelli|uno)
(lui|lei|loro|lo|la|li|le|suo|sua)
